# Ukrainian: the rules the formant voice speaks it by (docs/tts.md,
# "Other languages"). Written from Ukrainian spelling, which is read as written, with no vowel reduction: the iotated letters, the apostrophe, г and ґ. Stress is not written and is guessed (the last syllable after a consonant, else the second-last).
name Ukrainian
stress penult
last-if-ends бвгґджзйклмнпрстфхцчшщь
unstressed 2
vowels аеєиіїоуюя
weak і й в у з із зі до на по за від а але не та що як

r #[є] = Y E
r V[є] = Y E
r {ь'}[є] = Y E
r [є] = E
r #[ю] = Y U
r V[ю] = Y U
r {ь'}[ю] = Y U
r [ю] = U
r #[я] = Y A
r V[я] = Y A
r {ь'}[я] = Y A
